              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to National Association of Manufacturers, nAM argues that the Clean Water Act provides a narrow jurisdictional rule for appellate review, based on Section\u202f1369(b)(1)."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "National Association of Manufacturers",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3e86501da6dfa2c9530ed2d4b85080b74b40f0b7aa010ac7b85d55cb0fe77bbb",
              "evidence_ids": [
