              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 6,
                "start": 6
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to National Association of Manufacturers, nAM warns that if challenges are brought in district courts, each must review the entire administrative record, potentially involving dozens of courts, and the record would be reviewed again on appeal."
        }
      ],
